# Phase 133.1, the baseline: PLANET LOCK on a mount that behaves like the
# 8SE measured on 2026-11-07 (RADUK_EMU_NEXSTAR=1: commands replace
# tracking, azimuth mirrored, tracking slightly mis-set). Calibration
# must take the axes from the hand control, and the lock must hold.
# Kochab, as motion.scn, because it is in the tracking band at any hour.
name    Guide: lock on the measured NexStar
timeout 300

env     RADUK_EMU_NEXSTAR=1
profile star.ini focuser position=168000

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Guide: lock
expect 30  NexStar semantics
wait   3
goto   Kochab
expect 120 SEARCHING
wait   3
press  PLANET LOCK
expect 60  [CAL] hand control tracking
expect 90  Calibration: app-driven axes
expect 120 Acquisition: Locked
absent 20  Guiding abandoned
shot   locked
